 "title": "Animal Feed for Cattle, Pigs, Chickens, Geese, and Sheep – Kalmbach Feeds®",
 "text": "Animal Feed for Cattle, Pigs, Chickens, Geese, and Sheep\n– Kalmbach Feeds®\nSkip to content\nClose menu\nSHOP ONLINE\nPRODUCTS\nPoultry\nBeef\nBlocks & Tubs\nSmall Animal\nDairy\nDeer & Wildlife\nRabbit\nEquine\nGoat\nSheep\nSpecialty\nSwine\nWild Bird\nWHERE TO BUY\nCAREERS\nLEARN\nChickens\nGoats & Sheep\nRabbits\nDucks\nPigs\nCattle\nOther Species\nKalmbach Feeds®\nWebinar\nFarm and Home\nWild Bird\nLivestock\nCONTACT\nLOG IN\nFOLLOW US\nInstagram\nFacebook\nLinkedIn\nCart\nClose cart\nDiscounts\nSee Final Price at Checkout\nShipping, taxes, and discount codes calculated at checkout.\nCheck out\nYour cart is currently empty.\nKalmbach Feeds®\nSHOP ONLINE\nPRODUCTS\nPoultry\nBeef\nBlocks & Tubs\nSmall Animal\nDairy\nDeer & Wildlife\nRabbit\nEquine\nGoat\nSheep\nSpecialty\nSwine\nWild Bird\nWHERE TO BUY\nCAREERS\nLEARN\nChickens\nGoats & Sheep\nRabbits\nDucks\nPigs\nCattle\nOther Species\nKalmbach Feeds®\nWebinar\nFarm and Home\nWild Bird\nLivestock\nCONTACT\nLOG IN\nSearch\nSite navigation\nCart\nSearch\nSearch\nWE PROMISE\nTo feed your animals as if they were our own.\nPOULTRY\nDAIRY\nBEEF\nEQUINE\nSWINE\nGOAT\nSHEEP\nDEER\nSPECIALTY\nRABBIT\nWILD BIRD\nDOG\nKalmbach Feeds manufactures a variety of poultry products including organic, non-GMO, and all natural feeds for chickens, layers, broilers, game birds, and turkeys.\nSHOP POULTRY PRODUCTS\nALL ABOUT POULTRY\nKalmbach Feeds manufactures a variety of premium dairy feed and products for every stage of life, including calves, heifers, dry and lactation rations.\nDAIRY PRODUCTS\nKalmbach Feeds is proud to offer a complete line of products for beef producers. Whether you’re in search of feeds, supplements, or minerals, we’ve got your herd covered.\nBEEF PRODUCTS\nWe offer competitively priced products designed specifically for your horse, whether a backyard friend, growing, breeding, or performance horse, from the show pen to the race track.\nEQUINE PRODUCTS\nKalmbach Feeds offers a complete line of high quality pig feeds designed to help you compete effectively in the market, whether you are striving to win the purple banner or deliver the lowest cost pork to your customer.\nSWINE PRODUCTS\nKalmbach Feeds offers milk replacers, starter feeds, maintenance feeds and minerals for your herd’s needs throughout all stages of development.\nGOAT PRODUCTS\nKalmbach Feeds manufactures a full line of sheep products, including milk replacers, creep feeds, ewe pellets, and more.\nSHEEP PRODUCTS\nOur full line of Heartland Wildlife™ deer feeds provide superior nutrition and everything you need for a complete deer management program.\nDEER PRODUCTS\nKalmbach Feeds has your specialty animal needs covered with a line of top quality feed products designed to meet the specific nutritional needs of Llamas, Alpacas, Ostriches and Emus.\nSPECIALTY PRODUCTS\nKalmbach Feeds offers a premium line of products for rabbits.\nRABBIT PRODUCTS\nKalmbach Feeds manufactures a variety of high-quality wild bird feeds designed to attract and nourish backyard birds throughout every season.\nWILD BIRD PRODUCTS\nALL ABOUT WILD BIRD\nWe are proud to offer a portfolio of premium dog products including dry food, wet food, and treats under our brand, Unrivaled. Our formulas provide premium nutrition built upon scientific insight; designed for how dogs truly live, grow, and thrive.\nVISIT UNRIVALEDPET.COM\nWelcome to the Kalmbach Collection, where you can celebrate your love for animals with a curated line of fun, functional, and stylish lifestyle accessories made just for animal lovers. These unique items bring personality and charm to everyday life with your animals!\nSHOP THE COLLECTION\nExplore the Kalmbach Wild Bird line—an assortment of premium blends and feeding options built to attract a variety of birds to your backyard. Rooted in the same care you trust, each purchase also supports the Feed Your Joy Fund—helping share the proven mental wellness benefits that come from feeding and watching wild birds.\nEXPLORE WILD BIRD FOOD\nJoin Our Team\nAt Kalmbach Feeds, we are committed to creating a safe and friendly work environment where you can learn, grow and succeed.\nSTART YOUR CAREER\nOn Farm Delivery\nWe excel at producing and delivering quality customized products to meet our customers’ unique needs.\nPARTNER WITH US\n“ WHATEVER IT TAKES\n”We will go the extra mile” isn’t just a saying, it’s what our team does day in and day out. Our team’s culture is to do whatever it takes to make sure our customers receive only the best quality and service, and to help them succeed.\nABOUT US\nOUR FAMILY OF BRANDS\nCONTACT US\nCONTACT US\n7148 State Hwy 199 Upper Sandusky, OH 43351\ninfo@kalmbachfeeds.com\nToll Free: 888-771-1250\nPhone: 419-294-3838\nFax: 419-294-4350\nRESOURCES\nRESOURCES\nFAQ’s\nBecome a Dealer\nAbout Us\nStewardship\nState Guides to Chicken Feed\nGrain Markets\nBRAND SITES\nBRAND SITES\nTribute Equine Nutrition\nFormula of Champions\nRight Choice Horse Feeds\nAntler King\nFOLLOW US\nInstagram\nFacebook\nLinkedIn\nPowered by Shopify\nPrivacy Policy Terms of Use Return Policy\nCopyright © 2023 Kalmbach Feeds. All rights reserved.\n\"Close (esc)\"\nAnimal Feed for Cattle, Pigs, Chickens, Geese, and Sheep",
